Package: HybPhaser
Title: Phasing of Sequence Reads for Polyploid Hybrids from Target Capture 
    Data
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Joel", "Nitta", , "joelnitta@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4719-7472"))
Description: HybPhaser detects hybrids by measuring heterozygosity in target 
    capture datasets and phases hybrid accessions by separating reads according 
    to similarity with selected taxa that represent parental clades. It is 
    designed as an extension to the HybPiper assembly pipeline.
